 ley\,” said Brandi Hardy\, Director of Marketing for Pacific Pearl. “W
 e look forward to gathering with families for an afternoon filled with col
 or\, creativity and memorable performances.” Admission is free. Activiti
 es and craft materials will be available while supplies last. Guests are e
