SUMMARY:[EDM] Moe's Alley Presents: Tania Cassette w/ HOLY WATER + DJ Arch
 ive 65
DTSTART:20260926T040000Z
DTEND:20260926T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260906T145222Z
UID:rZ7HnEZ1AfJ8qK
CATEGORIES:edm
DESCRIPTION:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/moes-alley-presents-tania-cass
 ette-moes-alley-tickets/14990753\nVenue: Moe's Alley\nLocation: 1535 Comme
 rcial Way\, Santa Cruz\, CA\nPrice: $25\nGenres: Music\, Alternative\, Got
 h\, Post-Punk\nCategories: edm\nSource: ticketmaster/music\n\nMoes Alley p
 resents Tania Cassette\, the voice of Glass Spells supporting the release 
 of her forthcoming LP The Death of Me! Special guest HOLY WATER opens the 
 show plus DJ Archive 65. Friday\, September 25\, 2026Doors: 8pm / Show: 9p
 m$20 in advance / $25 day of the show21+* No Refunds | All sales are final
 * Avoid scammers! Only purchase tickets from moesalley.com or ticketweb.co
 m* Tickets requested by email will be delivered 3 days prior to the event*
  Will Call tickets will be available at the door on the day of the event==
 ==TANIA CASSETTETania Cassette is a synthpop and dark pop artist with an 8
 0s glow and a modern dance heartbeat\, built on hooks that land fast and l
 inger long into the night. Known as the voice of Glass Spells\, she emerge
 d into her solo era with singles The Flame and Por Tu Amor leading into he
 r debut album The Death of Me\, out September 4th. Shimmering\, dancefloor
  ready\, and heavy with yearning\, the record moves through passion and re
 birth in a world of nostalgic tenderness and dark glamour.HOLY WATERJacob 
 came up in the Punk / Hardcore scene in Northern California. Jacobs band L
